{'symbol': 'STT', 'date': '2020-08-13 07:30:00', 'title': 'STATE STREET EXPANDS MIDDLE EAST PRESENCE WITH NEW OFFICE IN SAUDI ARABIA', 'text': 'OPENS FIRST SAUDI ARABIA OFFICE, STATE STREET SAUDI ARABIA FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS COMPANY (STATE STREET SAUDI ARABIA), IN RIYADH.STATE STREET SAUDI ARABIA IS AUTHORIZED TO CONDUCT DEALING AS AGENT, DISCRETIONARY PORTFOLIO MANAGEMENT, ADVISING AND CUSTODY ACTIVITIES.STATE STREET SAUDI ARABIA APPOINTED ABDULLAH SALEH BAKHREBAH AS CEO AND MANAGING DIRECTOR.STATE STREET SAUDI ARABIA APPOINTED HAIFA AL GOUFI AS MIDDLE EAST AND NORTH AFRICA (MENA) CHIEF COMPLIANCE OFFICER AND HASSAN AL KHALAF AS MENA CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER.'}